@Users.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002

### Listar usuarios
GET {{Users.API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Obtener un usuario por id (María, precargada)
GET {{Users.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-111122223333
Accept: application/json

### Registrar un usuario
POST {{Users.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "Pérez",
  "email": "ana@email.com",
  "password": "MiPassword123!"
}

### Login
POST {{Users.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@email.com",
  "password": "MiPassword123!"
}
